      "message": "[warning] Line 114: 🟡 `Pulse.start(...)` creates an infinite animator per row, but cancellation currently relies only on `onViewRecycled`. Rows that are detached with the RecyclerView/dialog teardown may never hit recycle, leaving animators running longer than intended. Cancel the row pulse in a detach lifecycle path as well (e.g., `onViewDetachedFromWindow`, and/or explicitly stop all active holder pulses when the adapter/recycler is detached).",
